 the developer has thoughtfully removed this part for you (actually, out of laziness).<br></li><li>A dice-based check system involving four attributes: Strength, Dexterity, Charisma, and Perception.<br></li><li>Multiple playable characters, each with their own backstories and stats.<br></li><li>Rich scripts and short stories, each with different flavors and themes.<br></li><li>Tons of random events; if you fail an investigation, blame the &quot;dealer&quot; and try again.</li></ul>", "short_description": "This is a text-based horror game in which you investigate mysterious urban legends. Along the way, the player takes on the role of a character who gets “lost” and encounters a series of random events.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190430/header.jpg?t=1736515854", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190430/8556ee7bb81e9631a573b7cab5a8df2a9b8b3522/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736515854", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190430/8556ee7bb81e9631a573b7cab5a8df2a9b8b3522/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736515854", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB, OpenGL 3+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["FatCoke"], "publishers": ["FatCoke"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1499, "final": 1499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$14.99"}, "packages": [1131613], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Terror Diversion", "description": "", "selec